 hair and  just put it on there and try to do that  but i do feel like it is tugging a bit  on my hair which i'm not sure is the  best for it while it's wet  so if you've ever used one of these and  you can give me some tips or tell me  what your experiences were  let me know in the comments with hair  ties i usually do wear my hair in a  ponytail  i've been using these thick hair ties  that i got off ebay i'm pretty sure they  were  like ten dollars for a hundred or  something  but these are really good because they  don't have an end  so there's no rough snaggy bit that gets  caught on your hair the cats have been  stealing these so  every couple of years i just have to buy  200 and that usually lasts me  i think i straight up forgot to talk  about this last time but i also have  this shaver  so i have an undercut because my hair i  just got too much hair  so i'll see if i can show  you oh  there it is so yeah i just have too much  hair  so i found that cutting that has made my  hair a lot thinner  a lot lighter and it dries a lot more  quickly so you can probably see how  messy the undercut is  and that's because i'd shave it myself  every once in a while i try to get  someone to help me shave it but  usually it's just me in the shower i  bend over and i use this  this is a remington shaver and i pretty  much just grope  to where the edge of my hair is and then  i move in a little bit and  just shave so yeah the edges are a bit  gross because i  don't want to cut off too much of the  long hair accidentally so i'd rather  cut off less than too much but yeah it's  surprisingly easy to do it myself  um you just have to like feel it and  then aim it  this is really nice and safe it doesn't  cut you or anything it just cuts hair  so you can just like do a lot of groping  without any sort of danger  so i hope this video was useful let me  know if you've used any of these  products before or if you have any  recommendations especially with a quick  hair dye  also with p